        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Linguist Deborah Tannen suggests that our “argument culture” is based on our tendency to regard “issues and ideas as absolute and irreconcilable principles continually at war,” and she challenges us to “[bring them] into balance as much as possible” (284).",
